  "content": {
    "title": "The Bachelorette 2026: Who Are the Men Who Competed for Taylor Frankie Paul's Heart?",
    "text": "1 of 23 Disney/Evan Mulling The men of The Bachelorette Season 22 UPDATE: ABC has pulled this season of The Bachelorette following allegations of domestic assault made by both Taylor Frankie Paul and her ex Dakota Mortensen. PREVIOUSLY: Taylor Frankie Paul, one of the stars of Hulu's breakout reality series The Secret Lives of Mormon Wives, is taking advantage of a little corporate synergy by being the main attraction of Season 22 of The Bachelorette. The new season, which begins on March 22, will see 22 men vying for her attention. But who are these flirtin' fellas with fun facts that range from \"I am a Disney adult\" to \"I once got attacked by a bird on a run\"? (Seriously, they said that.) Let's meet the guys of The Bachelorette Season 22. 2 of 23 Disney/Evan Mulling Aaron, The Bachelorette Age: 32 Occupation: Product Manager Hometown: Vineyard, Utah Fun Facts:Aaron's FYP is exclusively food content.Aaron cannot sleep past 7 a.m.Aaron says that while his car is old, it is always shiny. 3 of 23 Disney/Evan Mulling Brad, The Bachelorette Age: 29Occupation: Cowboy/EntrepreneurHometown: Newport Beach, CaliforniaFun Facts:Brad is working toward getting his private pilot's license.Brad would have been an incredible gladiator.Brad prefers a white rose to a red one … It's less basic. 4 of 23 Disney/Evan Mulling Brandon, The Bachelorette Age: 28Occupation: Loan OfficerHometown: Spearfish, South DakotaFun Facts:Brandon's all-time favorite movie is \"The Notebook.\"Brandon loves the smell of roasted marshmallows.Brandon does not do complex card games. 5 of 23 Disney/Evan Mulling Casey, The Bachelorette Age: 30Occupation: Mechanical EngineerHometown: Nashville, TennesseeFun Facts:Casey can't sleep without socks.Casey loves Steve Irwin.If Casey could have any job, he would be the director of a science museum. 6 of 23 Disney/Evan Mulling Christopher, The Bachelorette Age: 35Occupation: Business OwnerHometown: Vacaville, CaliforniaFun Facts:Christopher loves a good psychological thriller.Christopher looks great in a cowboy hat.Christopher prefers his music on vinyl. 7 of 23 Disney/Evan Mulling Clayton, The Bachelorette Age: 36Occupation: Singer/SongwriterHometown: Nashville, TennesseeFun Facts:Clayton LOVES flower bouquets.Clayton enjoys a good trail ride on horseback.Once Clayton visits Antarctica, he'll have been to every continent. 8 of 23 Disney/Evan Mulling Conrad, The Bachelorette Age: 32Occupation: Startup FounderHometown: Santa Monica, CaliforniaFun Facts:Conrad believes that food is merely a vessel for sauce.Conrad has been to Stagecoach 12 times.Conrad is an Eagle Scout. 9 of 23 Disney/Evan Mulling Doug, The Bachelorette Age: 32Occupation: Ocean LifeguardHometown: San Diego, CaliforniaFun Facts:Doug can ride a unicycle.Doug wants to learn guitar so he can serenade someone.Doug's love language is great banter. 10 of 23 Disney/Evan Mulling Johnnie, The Bachelorette Age: 30Occupation: Former Professional Baseball PlayerHometown: Massapequa, New YorkFun Facts:Johnnie's signature dance moves went viral on TikTok.Johnnie describes himself as a hoarder with order.Johnnie makes a mean steak. 11 of 23 Disney/Evan Mulling Josh, The Bachelorette Age: 28Occupation: Sales ManagerHometown: Provo, UtahFun Facts:Josh loves to indulge in a peanut butter burger.Josh is a Disney adult.Josh attends the Tulip Festival in Utah every year with his grandma. 12 of 23 Disney/Evan Mulling Kevin, The Bachelorette Age: 32Occupation: Physical TherapistHometown: Miami, FloridaFun Facts:Kevin is happiest when he's well fed.Kevin dreams of swimming with hammerhead sharks.Kevin loves to cry while listening to \"Crash\" by Dave Matthews Band. 13 of 23 Disney/Evan Mulling Lew, The Bachelorette Age: 32Occupation: Insurance Tech FounderHometown: Salt Lake City, UtahFun Facts:Lew is a Belieber.Lew loves brunchin' with the boys.Lew once won a twerking competition in Thailand. 14 of 23 Disney/Evan Mulling Malik, The Bachelorette Age: 30Occupation: Tech ExecutiveHometown: Brooklyn, New YorkFun Facts:Malik loves all things Halloween, especially costumes.Malik once had a mohawk, but he won't show you pictures.Malik has a playlist for every occasion. 15 of 23 Disney/Evan Mulling Marcus, The Bachelorette Age: 28Occupation: Creative DirectorHometown: Elmont, New YorkFun Facts:Marcus once got attacked by a bird while on a run.Marcus loves a good rooftop vibe.Marcus' favorite food is pancakes. 16 of 23 Disney/Evan Mulling Matt, The Bachelorette Age: 43Occupation: Real Estate BrokerHometown: Carmel, IndianaFun Facts:In another life, Matt would love to be a fashion photographer in Paris.Matt's favorite sound is his kids laughing.Nothing suits Matt like a suit. 17 of 23 Disney/Evan Mulling Michael B., The Bachelorette Age: 36Occupation: Chiropractic HealerHometown: San Diego, CaliforniaFun Facts:Michael loves fantasy novels.Michael taught himself how to firespin.Michael says the bass moves his soul. 18 of 23 Disney/Evan Mulling Mike T., The Bachelorette Age: 36 Occupation: Brand Protection Manager Hometown: Lavallette, New Jersey Fun Facts: Mike loves bonfires on the beach. Mike is an Aquaphor addict. Mike is his best self on a wedding dance floor. 19 of 23 Disney/Evan Mulling Richard, The Bachelorette Age: 35Occupation: PhotographerHometown: Charleston, South CarolinaFun Facts:Richard never misses a chance to go surfing.Richard loves hunting for shark teeth.Richard is thankful for Thanksgiving. 20 of 23 Disney/Evan Mulling Rod, The Bachelorette Age: 35Occupation: EntrepreneurHometown: Austin, TexasFun Facts:Rod loves a good aioli.Rod admits that it takes him a while to text back.Rod loves a Christmas movie marathon. 21 of 23 Disney/Evan Mulling Ronn, The Bachelorette Age: 28Occupation: Account ExecutiveHometown: San Francisco, CaliforniaFun Facts:Ronn has a 9-month-old betta fish named Finn.Ronn aspired to be Troy Bolton while growing up.Ronn thinks sloths are just pretending to be slow. 22 of 23 Disney/Evan Mulling Shane, The Bachelorette Age: 28Occupation: Private Wealth PlannerHometown: Atlanta, GeorgiaFun Facts:Shane is a massive Uno enthusiast.If Shane has something stuck in his teeth, he begs that you tell him.Shane keeps a running note of the best breakfast burritos he's ever had. 23 of 23 Disney/Evan Mulling Trenten, The Bachelorette Age: 35Occupation: Pro AthleteHometown: San Juan Capistrano, CaliforniaFun Facts:Trenten's dream superpower would be talking with dogs.Trenten lives with a Mamba Mentality.Trenten's favorite flower is a snapdragon.",
